# PC card team-portfolio (BENCH-231): one screen arm @A@ (the tmtab build of work/team-portfolio-@A@.java, every team's entry changed one way) on the teams the arm changes, 6 seeds from 15000, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm.
--team
true
--seeds
6
--seed-base
15000
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-portfolio-@A@.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@@A@.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@@A@
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-portfolio-@V@-@A@
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-portfolio-@A@.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
